drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I recently took an international\nflight to Tokyo with your company,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,399.976,404.368)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我最近搭乘貴公司的國際航班飛往東京，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,399.976,404.368)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='and I am thoroughly unsatisfied\nwith the experience.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,404.768,408.512)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我對這次經驗非常不滿意。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,404.768,408.512)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='When booking my flight through\nyour online booking service,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,408.912,412.728)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='透過線上預訂服務預訂航班時，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,408.912,412.728)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='I reserved a seat in business\nclass. I paid for this with my\ncredit card and can show the\nbooking fee on my statement.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,413.128,420.856)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我預訂了商務艙的座位。我用信用卡支付了費用，\n並且可以在我的帳單上顯示預訂費。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,413.128,420.856)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='However, when I checked in for the\nflight, I was told that the\ncounter staff could not find my\nreservation for business class.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,421.256,428.624)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='然而，當我辦理登機手續時，櫃檯工作人員告訴我\n找不到我的商務艙預訂。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,421.256,428.624)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Since the flight was leaving soon,\nI had no other choice but to\naccept a seat in economy.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,429.024,434.688)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='由於航班即將起飛，我只好選了經濟艙座位。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,429.024,434.688)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='The person at the counter said\nthey would have someone contact me\nafter I arrived in Tokyo about the\nmistake.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,435.088,441.424)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='櫃檯人員說，我到達東京後，他們會派人聯絡我，\n告知我這個錯誤。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,435.088,441.424)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Even after we had taken off, the\nflight attendants refused to allow\nme to move to business class,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,441.824,447.872)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='起飛後，空服員也不讓我轉商務艙，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,441.824,447.872)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='saying my ticket showed economy\nand that there was nothing they\ncould do.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,448.272,452.520)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='說我的機票顯示經濟並且他們無能為力。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,448.272,452.520)',
