drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Dear Ms. Banner,':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,506.000,507.896)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='親愛的班納女士，':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,506.000,507.896)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='We recently received your\ncomplaint regarding the mistake\nwith your flight. We would like to\nsincerely apologize for the error.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,508.296,516.168)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我們最近收到了您關於航班錯誤的投訴。對於這個\n錯誤，我們深表歉意。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,508.296,516.168)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='We have reviewed your initial\nreservation and found that you did\nindeed pay for a seat in business\nclass.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,516.568,522.616)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='我們審查了您的初始預訂，發現您確實支付了商務\n艙座位的費用。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,516.568,522.616)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Unfortunately, it seems there was\na problem with our servers at the\ntime of your reservation and some\ninformation was incorrectly saved.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,523.016,530.864)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='不幸的是，在您預訂時我們的伺服器似乎出現問題\n，並且某些資訊保存不正確。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,523.016,530.864)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='As this mistake was entirely our\nfault, we will be refunding you\nthe cost of your flight.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,531.264,537.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='由於這個錯誤完全是我們的過錯，我們將退還您的\n航班費用。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,531.264,537.048)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='This refund will be sent to the\ncredit card used to make the\nbooking.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,537.448,541.648)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='這筆退款將退至用於預訂的信用卡。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,537.448,541.648)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='Additionally, we will provide you\nwith an upgrade to business class\non your next flight, completely\nfree of charge.':fontcolor=white:fontsize=44:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.25-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,542.048,548.960)',
drawtext=fontfile='C\:/Windows/Fonts/msjh.ttc':text='此外，我們將在您的下一個航班上為您免費升級至\n商務艙。':fontcolor=white:fontsize=34:line_spacing=12:bordercolor=black:borderw=3:fix_bounds=true:x=(w-text_w)/2:y=max(60,min(h*0.70-text_h/2,h-text_h-60)):enable='between(t,542.048,548.960)',
